WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:04.447
Same app, new database, and real files broke it.

2
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:09.360
After a move from PostgreSQL to SQL Server,

3
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.667
client uploads failed and Download froze the browser.

4
00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:18.846
I reproduced each report on a restored copy and measured:

5
00:00:18.846 --> 00:00:21.925
a limit of twenty-one hundred parameters,

6
00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:25.679
a race on one connection, and a ten-second freeze.

7
00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:29.174
Batches sized from the driver's limit,

8
00:00:29.174 --> 00:00:33.359
writes one after another, and the export built on the server.

9
00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.899
Files are saved whole or not at all,

10
00:00:36.899 --> 00:00:43.555
and Download sends a file of under four megabytes instead of forty-three megabytes of data.

